            "review_title": "Review at Green Chili",
            "review_text": "Gyan B\nHuddinge, Sweden81 contributions\n0\nVery Disappointing Food Experience\nMar 2026 • Couples\nGreen Chilli Indian Restaurant in Hanoi was a very disappointing experience. We ordered samosa, aloo paratha, gobhi paratha, palak paneer, and steamed rice, but the food quality was extremely poor. The parathas were burnt and completely tasteless, making them difficult to eat. The samosas were soggy instead of crispy, which ruined the snack. Overall, the meal lacked freshness and authentic flavor. It was one of the worst Indian meals I have had, and unfortunately I would not recommend this restaurant to others.\nRead more\nWritten March 16, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
